              "y": 701.8781090318728
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "** Do not update these **",
              "color": "yellow"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-56339db1-d090-4c6e-a979-8dd1a8de038d",
            "name": "Note 3",
            "type": "canvasNote",
            "position": {
              "x": 132.6165340656915,
              "y": 150.82379549546732
            },
            "details": {
              "markdown": "** BEFORE TRIGGERING THE WORKFLOW **\n\nMake sure to update the grounding knowledge in the Agent actions.",
              "color": "red"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "canvasNote-1734799e-c3e4-4350-982b-9bdf7d91cab8",
