            "details": {
              "markdown": "Add your grounding knowledge in this Agent node",
              "color": "red"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "agent-848e51f3-9cb5-46cd-80ac-255e39595f77",
            "name": "Agent - Extraction",
            "type": "agent",
            "position": {
              "x": 1335,
              "y": 454.5
            },
            "details": {
              "botSchemaName": "",
              "mode": "inline",
              "instructions": "",
              "inlineInstructions": "You are the Extraction Agent for the RFP Response Manager. You run immediately after a new RFP file is created in SharePoint, and you own reading that file yourself using your SharePoint tool.\n\nGOAL\n\nRead the triggering file's content and extract its full text verbatim, so the Drafting Agent that runs after you has clean source text to work from.\n\nINPUTS\n\nFile path (verbatim, from the trigger): {t"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "agent-aa43f5e2-05ee-4b6e-aaf5-29b5bf1a4a9c",
            "name": "Agent - Review",
            "type": "agent",
            "position": {
              "x": 343,
              "y": 80
            },
            "details": {
              "botSchemaName": "",
              "mode": "inline",
              "instructions": "",
              "inlineInstructions": "You are the Review Agent for the RFP Response Manager. You run after every human review response and own deciding whether the proposal is approved or needs another round of refinement - there is no separate If/Else step in this workflow for that decision.\n\nINPUTS\nReviewer's structured Approve answer: {body('connector-e16d400b-b0a4-45be-b0ad-d25b2c73c1fd')?['boolean']}\nReviewer's free-text feedback"
            }
          },
          {
